{"type":"message","id":"8db9f003","parentId":"61e501d4","timestamp":"2026-03-30T10:00:11.631Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Thanks — that combination matters. **Dizziness, headaches, poor sleep, and reduced appetite** alongside worsening physical fatigue raises the importance of checking things like **blood pressure control**, dehydration, medication effects, anemia, kidney-related changes, and other metabolic causes.\n\n## Recommended questions\n**(3/4)** Do you know your **recent blood pressure readings**, and have there been **any medication changes** in the last few months — especially with **lisinopril, amlodipine, or anything new**?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0ec33241ee8fa4270169ca49a8ff688191a7192231b288f905\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9800,"output":113,"cacheRead":9856,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19769,"cost":{"input":0.0245,"output":0.0016950000000000001,"cacheRead":0.002464,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.028659}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774864807945}}
